_details_thumbnail_01_d1020703-f7d5-4fbf-8aa1-3586821d4163.jpg","image_mask":"none","image2_mask":"none","subtitle":"More power, less bulk","title":"Powerful, Compact Drive Unit","text":"<p>At the heart of Ride 60 is a compact drive unit producing up to <strong>60Nm of torque and 450W peak power<\/strong>, delivering strong assistance when the road turns uphill. The motor integrates gearbox, sensors, and electronics into a streamlined unit weighing just 1.96kg.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","image_width":"50","layout":"right","divider":true,"top_padding":true,"bottom_padding":false,"lazyload_images":true}},"text_and_image_UqjKni":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/fazua_ride_60_details_thumbnail_02.jpg","image_mask":"none","image2_mask":"none","subtitle":"Feels like a bike","title":"Balanced Ride Dynamics","text":"<p>The lightweight Ride 60 system helps bikes stay agile and responsive, preserving the lively ride feel performance riders expect. Advanced sensors respond instantly to pedal input, delivering smooth assistance that blends naturally with your pedal stroke.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","image_width":"50","layout":"left","divider":false,"top_padding":true,"bottom_padding":false,"lazyload_images":true}},"text_and_image_CY6VHk":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/fazua_ride_60_details_thumbnail_03.jpg","image_mask":"none","image2_mask":"none","subtitle":"Range for real rides","title":"Integrated 480Wh Battery","text":"<p>The compact energy <strong>480Wh battery<\/strong> delivers impressive range in a clean, fully integrated design. At just 2.2 kg, it balances power and efficiency while delivering ride distances comparable to many full-power e-bike systems, with customizable performance settings available through the FAZUA app<strong>.<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","image_width":"50","layout":"right","divider":false,"top_padding":true,"bottom_padding":false,"lazyload_images":true}},"text_and_image_7a6Ai4":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/fazua_ride_60_details_thumbnail_04.jpg","image_mask":"none","image2_mask":"none","subtitle":"Simple rider control","title":"Intuitive Controls & Connectivity","text":"<p>Ride 60 keeps rider interaction simple and intuitive. The Ring Control lets riders change assist modes without removing a hand from the bar, while the LED Hub displays system status and battery level. The FAZUA app allows riders to customize support levels and tune system performance.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","image_width":"50","layout":"left","divider":false,"top_padding":true,"bottom_padding":false,"lazyload_images":true}},"shogun_custom_html_PXfijd":{"type":"shogun-custom-html","name":"Shogun Custom HTML","settings":{"html":"<div id=\"Available-Bikes\"><\/div>"}},"featured_collection_wBrxMt":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"t:sections.featured-collection.presets.featured_collection.name","settings":{"title":"Powered by Fazua Ride 60","home_featured_products":"bikes-powered-by-fazua-ride-60","per_row":4,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":false,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"shogun_custom_html_Hwapj4":{"type":"shogun-custom-html","name":"Shogun Custom HTML","settings":{"html":"<div id=\"Service\"><\/div>"}},"text_and_image_jKryp7":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/san_rafael_store.jpg","image_mask":"none","image2_mask":"none","subtitle":"","title":"Expert Support. Faster Service.","text